{% comment %}
  Foundation placeholder for the "View in Your Room" / "View in Your Space"
  app block. Not wired to any deployed extension yet -- see README.md in
  this directory. When built out, this block will:
    - Read the product's published AR/3D model reference (synced from this
      app's `/ar/:token` handoff) via a product metafield.
    - Render Google `<model-viewer>` with `ar` enabled, plus a "View in Your
      Room" button, only when a PUBLISHED model exists for the product.
    - Fall back to rendering nothing when no model is published, so it never
      changes a product page's appearance for ineligible products.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="infini-homes-ar-block" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}">
  <!-- Placeholder: no model-viewer markup yet. This block is not deployed. -->
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "View in Your Room (AR)",
  "target": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
